      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KELLY ESTATES are delighted to bring to the market this beautiful first floor own door entrance, two bedroom apartment for sale. The accommodation includes a bright and welcoming entrance hall, bright and airy living room and a wonderful modern kitchen, two bedrooms, main bathroom and balcony.\n\nAn ideal opportunity for to purchase a wonderful 1st floor 2 bedroom apartment in a fantastic location. Situated in the picturesque village of Newcastle, Co. Dublin, this property in Newcastle Manor forms part of a beautifully designed and well balanced development that includes a mix of two, three and four bedroom houses in a well established residential area.\n\nThis beautiful family home is only minutes walk to a host of amenities including schools, shops and a wide range of services in Newcastle Village. There is easy access to the City Centre with an excellent bus network on the doorstep and also the N7, M50 & N4 motorways are close by. The property comprising of entrance hall, lounge, kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms, main bathroom.\n\nLocated in the wonderful Newcastle Village, with access to an abundance of local amenities, some of which include shops, schools, restaurants and churches. The property itself is convenient for Dublin Airport M50, N4, N7 and a short distance from Dublin City Centre. This property also benefits from 68 & 6w bus routes.\n"
      },
